     2| * IVX Live Deployment Dashboard
     3| *
     4| * Real-time status display for all deployment tools:
     5| *   - GitHub HEAD commit
     6| *   - Render deployed commit
     7| *   - Production commit
     8| *   - Commit match status
     9| *   - Auto-deploy status
    10| *   - Supabase status
    11| *   - Errors and blockers
    12| *   - Next automatic action
    13| */
    14|
    15|import React, { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from 'react';
    16|import {
    17|  View,
    18|  Text,
